       pnmdepth - replaced by pamdepth


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       Starting  with Netpbm 10.32 (February 2006), ppnnmmddeepptthh is obsolete.  Use
       ppaammddeepptthh(1) instead.

       ppaammddeepptthh is  backward  compatible  with  ppnnmmddeepptthh.   You  can  use  the
       ppaammddeepptthh  manual  for ppnnmmddeepptthh as long as you ignore features that were
       added after Netpbm 10.31.

       For backward compatibility, the name 'pnmdepth' continues to  exist  as
       an  alias for 'pamdepth'.  But because of a bug, that name doesn't work
       in Netpbm 10.32.  You have to fix the symbolic link.

